OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTurning
OL,6,Fincreasingly cloudy during the evening
OL,7,Fwith some light rain by the morning,
OL,8,Fthis may turn to sleet over high
OL,9,Fground for a time. Winds remain light.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FCloudy with a band of rain
OL,12,Fmoving eastwards across the region,
OL,13,Fthis could fall as sleet over high
OL,14,Fground. Winds will increase, becoming
OL,15,Fbreezy.
